### file redirect inside a substitution
checksum=$(sha256sum app.tar > sums.txt)
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2327 1:10
>>> SC2328 1:30

### fd 1 redirect inside backticks
checksum=`sha256sum app.tar 1> sums.txt`
>>> SC2006 1:10
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2327 1:10
>>> SC2328 1:29

### append inside a brace substitution
checksum=${ sha256sum app.tar >> sums.txt; }
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2327 1:10
>>> SC2328 1:31

### redirect on the last pipeline stage
checksum=$(sha256sum app.tar | cut -d' ' -f1 > sum.txt)
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2327 1:10
>>> SC2328 1:46

### redirect to the null device
checksum=$(sha256sum app.tar > /dev/null)
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2327 1:10
>>> SC2328 1:30

### stderr captured then stdout discarded
warnings=$(make 2>&1 >/dev/null)
>>> SC2034 1:1

### two statements second redirected
checksum=$(cd dist; sha256sum app.tar > sums.txt)
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2164 1:12

### two statements first redirected
checksum=$(cd dist > /dev/null; sha256sum app.tar)
>>> SC2034 1:1
>>> SC2164 1:12

### input duplication
line=$(head -n1 <&3)
>>> SC2034 1:1
